-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OGS 2020 Q1","e":"ogs","d":"2020-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Curtis L. Dinan","x":"As required by our tariff, we will file a full rate case in 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/one-gas-inc-ogs-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OGS 2020 Q1","e":"ogs","d":"2020-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Curtis L. Dinan","x":"And so that then gets rebuild through the normal gas pass-through mechanism that's in place.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/one-gas-inc-ogs-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OGS 2020 Q2","e":"ogs","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Shar Pourreza","x":"And then just lastly, given the weak HDDs year-to-date, what level of cost deferral and cost savings are being contemplated for 2020?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/one-gas-inc-ogs-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OGS 2020 Q2","e":"ogs","d":"2020-07-28","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Shar Pourreza","x":"And how does that bridge to your reaffirmed guidance?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/one-gas-inc-ogs-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OGS 2020 Q3","e":"ogs","d":"2020-11-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Curtis L. Dinan","x":"RNG is actually contemplated in the tariffs in Texas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/one-gas-inc-ogs-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2020 Q3","e":"ogs","d":"2020-11-03","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Agnieszka Zmigrodzka","x":"Is there a regulatory framework in place to invest in RNG across your jurisdictions as we have tariffs established to potentially cover some additional costs related to investments in RNG, any color would be helpful.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/one-gas-inc-ogs-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2020 Q4","e":"ogs","d":"2021-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Caron A. Lawhorn","x":"Our purchased gas costs are recoverable through the tariffs in each state where we operate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/one-gas-inc-ogs-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2020 Q4","e":"ogs","d":"2021-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Curtis L. Dinan","x":"And as a reminder, in Oklahoma, we are required under our tariff to file a full rate case on or before June 30 this year, which will be based on calendar 2020 test year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/one-gas-inc-ogs-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2021 Q1","e":"ogs","d":"2021-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Caron A. Lawhorn","x":"Our purchase gas costs are recoverable through tariffs in each state where we operate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/one-gas-inc-ogs-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2021 Q1","e":"ogs","d":"2021-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Curtis L. Dinan","x":"In Oklahoma, we are required by our performance-based rate tariff to file a full rate case on or before June 30 of this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/one-gas-inc-ogs-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2021 Q1","e":"ogs","d":"2021-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Curtis L. Dinan","x":"It is a straight pass through to our customers and allows the company, our customers, regulators and legislators to be aligned in finding the best solution for storm-related cost recovery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/one-gas-inc-ogs-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2021 Q2","e":"ogs","d":"2021-08-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Curtis Dinan","x":"If the KCC approves the proposed financing plan then Kansas Gas Service will file an application for a financing order for the issuance of securitized utility tariff bonds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/one-gas-inc-ogs-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2021 Q2","e":"ogs","d":"2021-08-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Curtis Dinan","x":"…methodical and going through evaluating the sources of RNG that are available, establishing the tariffs and the gas quality specs that would be necessary to bring that product into our system, and the interconnect agreements necessary to do that. So, that we're prepared for where directionally…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/one-gas-inc-ogs-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2021 Q3","e":"ogs","d":"2021-11-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Curtis L. Dinan","x":"Oklahoma Natural Gas is required to file an application requesting approval of an opt-in tariff for customers to select all or a portion of their fuel source to be RNG.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/one-gas-inc-ogs-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2025 Q2","e":"ogs","d":"2025-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert S. McAnnally","x":"We delivered strong operational and financial results, raised our full year guidance, advanced regulatory efforts across all jurisdictions and strengthened our capital position.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/one-gas-ogs-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2025 Q3","e":"ogs","d":"2025-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert McAnnally","x":"In August, we raised our full year guidance on strong year-to-date financial performance and the expected impact of Texas House Bill 4384.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/one-gas-ogs-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2025 Q4","e":"ogs","d":"2026-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Curtis L. Dinan","x":"We have no full rate cases planned until the Oklahoma filing in 2027 as required by our tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/one-gas-ogs-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2025 Q4","e":"ogs","d":"2026-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Curtis L. Dinan","x":"And being able to be very transparent about what is included in our rates, how charges to that customer would be funded, if there are any customer payments required for the construction, it is very transparent by being able to look at our tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/one-gas-ogs-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2025 Q4","e":"ogs","d":"2026-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sid McAnnally","x":"As a result, across our service territory, over 80% of the gas supply needed during the storm was shielded from temporary price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/one-gas-ogs-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2026 Q1","e":"ogs","d":"2026-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher Sighinolfi","x":"As a reminder, we do not have any full rate cases planned until we file the Oklahoma rate case in 2027 as required by tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/one-gas-ogs-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2026 Q1","e":"ogs","d":"2026-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Curtis Dinan","x":"Probably the easiest way is if you look at what our tariff is, and I've given you what the volumes are, but we've not made a specific comment about what the total of that would be.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/one-gas-ogs-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OGS 2026 Q2","e":"ogs","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher Paul Sighinolfi","x":"We do not have any full rate cases planned, until we file the Oklahoma rate case in 2027 as required by tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcr